<details class="markdown-help">
    <summary>Markdown formatting help</summary>
    <div class="markdown-help-grid">
        <code>**Bold text**</code><span><strong>Bold text</strong></span>
        <code>*Italic text*</code><span><em>Italic text</em></span>
        <code>==Highlighted text==</code><span><mark>Highlighted text</mark></span>
        <code>~~Completed text~~</code><span><del>Completed text</del></span>
        <code>&#96;inline code&#96;</code><span><code>inline code</code></span>
        <code>[Link label](https://example.com)</code><span>Clickable link</span>
        <code># Heading</code><span>Heading (levels 1–3)</span>
        <code>- List item</code><span>Bulleted list</span>
        <code>1. List item</code><span>Numbered list</span>
        <code>&gt; Important note</code><span>Quoted note</span>
    </div>
    <p class="mb-0">Use a blank line for a new paragraph. Raw HTML is displayed as text for security.</p>
</details>
